"""projects — census of cdpath work-trees, with .practica overlay.

Immediate children of each cdpath parent; first match wins (same as cd).
$HOME is skipped by default (last-resort catch-all, not a project container).

Census details live in census-details.txt (drop-globs, per-parent `only`,
disposition-default blobs). Each surviving root gets a `.practica` file:
detected/cached fields live in `.practica` and are reused until
git/session mtimes move, or `--refresh`. Frozen names stay put.

Default listing/heatmap order is canonical (cdpath, then lexical).
"""

